    "db5496048fee31f6e1ab42583d0295b90800f344265c03b757b36b681803dab3": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "14dbac49beb6bbc42284548e8bf870da0d2bafcaf17036bbebaea62e1fdfa67d",
      "contextFingerprint": "6e37c3bd10ff54e6d92eea285ba798c3785b27d84c90a987dde5353cdd50a54b",
      "sourceText": "| 对比点 | `#include` | `import module` |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| 工作方式 | 文本复制，把头文件内容粘进当前文件 | 导入已经编译好的模块接口 |\n| 可见性 | 头文件里写了什么，包含者基本都能看到 | 只有 `export` 的名字对外可见 |\n| 宏 | 宏容易向后污染 | 模块接口不会像文本包含那样传播宏 |\n| 编译依赖 | include 顺序可能影响结果 | 模块依赖更明确 |\n| 构建要求 | 所有编译器和构建系统都成熟支持 | 需要较新的编译器和构建系统 |",
      "translatedText": "| Comparison point | `#include` | `import module` |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| Working method | Copy text, paste the header file contents into the current file | Import an already\\-compiled module interface |\n| Visibility | Whatever is written in the header file is basically visible to includers | Only the name of `export` is visible externally |\n| Macros | Macros tend to leak outward | Module interfaces do not propagate macros the way text inclusion does |\n| Compilation dependency | Include order may affect the result | Module dependencies are clearer |\n| Build requirements | All compilers and build systems support it maturely | Requires relatively new compilers and build systems |",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 226,
        "outputTokens": 120,
        "costUsd": 0.000212
      }
    },
